{
  "id": "poem-071",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">众生苦海无尽头，悉达多子寻菩提。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">彼岸花开雨濛濛，心灯，点燃普照大地春。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">菩提树下禅境深，涅槃，摘星摘月跻苍穹。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">度尽六道脱生死，金身，照耀三千世界空。</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/071.webp\" data-caption=\"《树》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《树》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/071.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《树》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《树》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 71 页</p>"
}
